+// three makes it neither, and the opener closes once the count is down to
+// nothing. What a run counts as depends only on the characters either side of
+// it, so the counts are summed once per paragraph, and a running minimum from
+// the end says whether an opener's count ever gets there. If it cannot, the
+// walk would find nothing and is skipped. Emphasis nested thousands deep ran
